#: ../../../sensors.md:61
msgid "`ign topic -e -t /imu`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../sensors.md:63
msgid ""
"The last command listens to the messages sent over the `/imu` topic. The IMU "
"data are `orientation`, `angular_velocity` and `linear_acceleration` as "
"described above. It should look like this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../sensors.md:65
msgid "![Imu_message](tutorials/sensors/imu_msgs.png)"
msgstr ""

